#: ../../source/docs/git-clone.rst:5 0494454a36c443dbb45e9945258a1cdb
msgid "Clone a repository"
msgstr "克隆仓库"

#: ../../source/docs/git-clone.rst:12 d2e0629cd2f8492b9b36ade80b70ffbf
msgid ""
"\"Cloning\" is git's term for making a local copy of a remote repository "
"(i.e. one held on the GitHub servers)."
msgstr "「克隆」是 git 对制作远程仓库（即存放在 GitHub 服务器上的仓库）本地副本的术语。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-clone.rst:14 28b84f286ca942e2988610beddf44baf
msgid ""
"Developers should clone the main `ArduPilot repository "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__ (if they simply want to download"
" and compile the latest code) or their own :ref:`fork <git-fork>` (if they "
"want to make changes to the source code and potentially submit changes "
"back)."
msgstr ""
"开发者应克隆主 `ArduPilot 仓库 <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__ "
"（如果只是想下载并编译最新代码），或克隆自己的 :ref:`fork <git-fork>` （如果想修改源码并可能提交更改）。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-clone.rst:16 1997fd9ee8e841ff87b392567aee21a8
msgid ""
"Instructions for commonly used tools are below but whichever tool is used, "
"the URL for the source repo will be required.  This can be found on the "
"right side of the screen on each Github repository home page but in general "
"the URL is:"
msgstr "常用工具的使用说明如下，无论使用哪种工具，都需要源仓库的 URL。该 URL 可在每个 Github 仓库主页右侧找到，一般格式为："

#: ../../source/docs/git-clone.rst:18 1a779ccd401f4215bce834617179da84
msgid ""
"``https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot.git`` for the main ardupilot repo"
msgstr "``https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot.git`` （ArduPilot 主仓库）"

#: ../../source/docs/git-clone.rst:19 5159a720e06043ef99536d8b244e5336
msgid ""
"``https://github.com/your-github-account/ardupilot`` for your :ref:`fork "
"<git-fork>` of the ardupilot repo"
msgstr ""
"``https://github.com/your-github-account/ardupilot`` （你的 ArduPilot "
":ref:`fork <git-fork>`）"

#: ../../source/docs/git-clone.rst:24 5ebbfe27c87843519be74e63cdd56d29
msgid "Cloning with the command line"
msgstr "通过命令行克隆"

#: ../../source/docs/git-clone.rst:26 421a62d7464041eb8eb661c5c647e594
msgid ""
"open a terminal and navigate to the directory where you would like the clone"
" to be stored"
msgstr "打开终端，切换到你希望存储克隆仓库的目录"

#: ../../source/docs/git-clone.rst:27 604daf349f2e4459b022a928773064fc
msgid "clone your fork:"
msgstr "克隆您的 fork："

#: ../../source/docs/git-clone.rst:44 cdd4339fa4e14f6480cf7a8aeae9858e
msgid "Cloning with the GitHub GUI (Windows or MAC)"
msgstr "通过 GitHub GUI 克隆（Windows 或 Mac）"

#: ../../source/docs/git-clone.rst:46 d6ccf2428cf84c11b5e7fc1379e9f8bb
msgid "ensure you have installed the :ref:`GitHub for Desktop <git-install>`"
msgstr "确保已安装 :ref:`GitHub Desktop <git-install>`"

#: ../../source/docs/git-clone.rst:47 fe75c60a05114e5c8b04adc984ca71df
msgid ""
"open the `ArduPilot repo <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__ in your"
" favorite web browser"
msgstr "在您常用的浏览器中打开 `ArduPilot 仓库 <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/git-clone.rst:48 68f16d33ff4443c6a276c240df06eed9
msgid ""
"click on the green \"Clone or download\" button and select \"Open in "
"Desktop\" and follow the instructions"
msgstr "点击绿色「Clone or download」按钮，选择「在 Desktop 中打开」，然后按照提示操作"
